window.products.push({"id":503094,"name":"BOSKA Wooden Serving Cheese Board - Amigo Best For Cheese, Tapas, Bread, and Desserts Presentation - Board Slab with Non-Slip Feet - Cutting and Charc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+u0Ui-31L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Cheese Board Amigo Tapas “M”Tick tock, tick tock, it’s time for tapas! Give your guests an evening to remember by serving up a delicious and delightful tapas presentation. This board has a useful handle, letting you serve your guests with the greatest ease. It’s made of one solid piece of beech wood, and its light tint compliments the vibrant colors of the cheese and tapas. Just add a glass of fruity wine, and you’re good to go!- PERFECT FOR TAPAS: The rectangular shape makes this board ideal to present and sample different tapas- EUROPEAN DESIGN: Rustic beech wood board- HANDY: Nice handle for hanging and easy serving- HYGIENIC: Wood has a natural antiseptic quality and is kind to knivesThe fine art of tapasTapas come from Spanish cuisine. What fits better with a night of drinking and good company than small, tasteful snacks? Tapas come in all forms, flavors, and temperatures: cheese, charcuterie, olives, dips, chutneys, and spreads for on bread, meatballs, potatoes, prawns, squid; the list goes on and on.SizeThe board is 17.5” x 4.3” - large enough to present two or three cheeses or tapas.MaintenanceThis board is hand wash only - wood is not dishwasher safe. Use warm water and soap to rinse it off, and leave it to dry vertically so the board will not warp. A monthly rub of mineral oil will keep the wood looking great.About Boska Holland Cheese waresWe love cheese! Since 1896, here at Boska, it’s been our mission to spread the love of cheese to everyone everywhere. Our innovative family-owned company started as a blacksmith making tools for the cheese farmers in Holland, and now we are the world’s only specialist in Cheese wares: cheese tools and accessories. In short: we sell everything you need to enjoy cheese except the cheese itself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+u0Ui-31L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B082PL1KYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082PL1KYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082PL1KYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
