window.products.push({"id":503101,"name":"Panvola PhD in Progress Future Dr Doctor Medical Doctorate Student Graduation Gift Ceramic Coffee Mug (11 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tE6DI5e4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTIMATE GIFT MUG THAT STANDS OUT FROM THE REST: The perfect way to show the world that you're on your way to becoming a medical pro! This mug is perfect for medical students and aspiring doctors and is sure to be a hit in the classroom or the hospital. Featuring the words \"PhD in Progress\", this mug is a humorous reminder that becoming a doctor is no easy feat. And remember, \"A great doctor is not born, but made through sleepless nights and endless studying.\" PREMIUM COFFEE MUG: This high-quality ceramic mug has a premium hard coat that provides crisp and vibrant color reproduction sure to last for years. Printed on both sides for either left or right-handed person so the awesome message and art will be visible. High-gloss and has a premium finish that can make you enjoy your drink more. Can also be used as pen holders on your office work table, planter for your kitchen herb, jewelry holder, or serving your favorite dessert. RELATABLE HUMOROUS QUOTE: Why settle for a boring old mug when you can have this one-of-a-kind drinkware on your dining, kitchen, or work table? Bring a smile to your loved ones' faces with this hilarious mug. Featuring a witty and relatable quote, this mug is sure to brighten anyone's day. Whether you're enjoying your morning coffee or taking a well-deserved break at work, this mug is the perfect pick-me-up. A conversation starter, it's also a surefire way to lift anyone's mood. HILARIOUS AND QUIRKY GIFT: It's not just the functional aspects that make this mug stand out. Its humorous design is what makes it a truly special and memorable gift. Whether it's to celebrate birthdays, anniversaries, graduation, holidays, retirement, Christmas, or any special milestone that occurs in life, this mug is sure to bring a smile to their face and some laughter to their day. The perfect present for anyone who loves a good laugh! DISHWASHER AND MICROWAVE SAFE: These fantastic drinking mugs can go straight in the dishwasher, all day every day, meaning it can save you time, and be more hygienic. Perfect for your favorite hot or cold beverages. Easily reheat that coffee or tea you forgot to drink right away because it is microwave safe. Saves you time, is very convenient, and is perfect for your busy lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tE6DI5e4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panvola","source_asin":"B0BNVQPTW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNVQPTW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNVQPTW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
