window.products.push({"id":503103,"name":"WICOLO Stone Bath Mat, Diatomaceous Earth Shower Mat Non Slip Instantly Removes Water Drying Fast Bathroom Mat Natural Easy to Clean (23.5 * 15inch, L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816jVusK6PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Drying Fast】WICOLO bath mat is made of diatomaceous Earth which is a natural ultra-compact material made from fossilized plankton. It holds exceptional absorbency that quickly evaporates water from the surface. 【Built to Last】Low maintenance cost, no need to keep replacing your mat, its absorbency can be restored using included sandpaper. You can also use the sandpaper every few months for buffing the mat to keep it fresh and clean. 【Non Slip】 WICOLO bath stone comes with a silicone non slip mat which could provide strong grips. Place it underneath the diatomite mat to give it a good grip on the floor and keep the mat in its place 【Minimalist Bathroom Ma】 Refresh your bathroom, also the diatomite stone mat can be used as a Bathroom mat, Pool mat, Pet bowl mat, Dish pad and more. 【Warranty】We provide 1 year no worry warranty, if you have any problem with the stone bath mat, please feel free to contact us to get help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816jVusK6PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WICOLO","source_asin":"B0BRVC5C81","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRVC5C81","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRVC5C81","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":503104,"name":"UPDATED Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags | Sandwich Bags, Airtight Seal Freezer Bags, Sous Vide, Liquid, Snack, Lunch, Fruit, Fresh Produce Bags | ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YUb1xI71L._AC_SL1168_.jpg","description":"Are you already a customer of reusable silicone bags?Do you always have a hard time sliding the plastic rod on the bag?Is it always difficult for you to store your food or belongings inside because it stands flimsy and hard to open? THEN SHPEBS REUSABLE SILICONE BAGS ARE DEFINITELY FOR YOU. We have upgraded the design with 3 new upgrades you won’t find anywhere. 1. A much better base so the reusable storage bags will stand in a better position and will be easier to store food inside the reusable bags. You won't need a bag rack anymore! 2. A hole on the bottom so it will be easier and faster to dry them, just hang it and let it dry. 3. Matt finish from the inside so it won’t stick and won’t give you a hard time to open. OTHER FEATURES: 1. CONVENIENT - Easy to clean in dishwasher - Soft and foldable that can be easily stored in handbags & lunch bags while saving space. 2. SAFE FOR BABIES & PETS - Food Grade Silicone, BPA and BPS Free - 100% safe, non-toxic, non-reactive, non-allergenic, and tasteless - Hard for babies to open because of its airtight zip seal feature 3. HEAT + COLD RESISTANT - Temperature range: -76°F ~ 428°F (-60ºC ~ 220ºC), - work as thermal bag for boil-in-the-bag products, safe to use in sous vide cooker, microwave, steamer, refrigerator, freezer 4. LEAK PROOF - Best for liquids, such as soup, sauce and smoothie What’s Included: 4x large bags 50oz: 0.49lb 4x medium bags 30oz: 0.3lb1x Cleaning scrubber 1x Instruction manual ☞Warm Tips: ⚠ Please REMOVE SLIDER BARS when heating in microwave. Before first use, please soak in saltwater for 24 hours, and put it in the airing area to dry. If you want to use the leakproof function, remember to slide the bar to the end. When using the bags in Microwave or Oven, do, do not seal completely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YUb1xI71L._AC_SL1168_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"shpebs","source_asin":"B07TWR4HC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TWR4HC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TWR4HC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
