window.products.push({"id":503135,"name":"TQVAI Bamboo Coffee Station Organizer, 6 Compartments Condiment Rack Breakroom Accessories Caddy for K-Pods, Snack, Tea Bags, Disposable Cups, Origina","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mBaBsqTrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Bamboo Life, Eco-Life】Made of recyclable phyllostachys heterocycla(a kind of bamboo), 100% real bamboo material, Not cheap bamboo, synthetic wood or press wood; Bamboo is recyclable material, the bamboo products is not only look high-end and practical, but also eco-friendly; 【Premium Surface Finish】What we different from other bamboo product finish is that each of our bamboo product surface is wiped with the food-grade wood wax oil three times, compared with other bamboo product sold, ours appear to be more uniform in color, smoother and more durable to use; 【Extra Space Provided】6 Compartments condiment organizer, provide enough space for your countertop to storage k-cups, snack, tea bags, disposable coffees or any break rooms accessories; The top 3 compartments size is approximately 4.33”W x 3.78”D, which can hold up to 20oz(600ml) size disposable cups, greatly useful for parties and gatherings, of course this bamboo station is also fit in office, cafes and restaurant; 【Size Measurement(Inch)】Total size: 13.97”W x 6.7”D x 11.22”H; Bottom 3 compartments: 4.33”W x 6.14”D; Top 3 Compartments: 4.33”W x 3.78”D; We always encourage our customers check the size before purchase, so can help them check whether the product size meet their need; 【Hassle-free to Buy】We take responsibility for the items that purchased in our Amazon TQVAI store, Please feel free to contact us from amazon if you meet any issues of our product, we will 100% resolve your problems;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mBaBsqTrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TQVAI","source_asin":"B0B1H47RQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1H47RQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1H47RQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":503136,"name":"YULINK 8x10 Vintage Picture Frame, Antique Ornate Gold Octagon Photo Frame with Mat, for Tabletop and Wall Display, Decorative Retro Home Decor, Old F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mDFPoM2gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT VINTAGE DESIGN - The vintage 8x10 picture frame has a charming octagonal shape and detailed floral design with artistic Victorian embellishments, making it a beautiful way to display your favorite pictures, portraits, landscapes, art prints, especially black and white or more formal ones. The pretty large octagon frame keeps your precious memories, and also adds a nice touch of luxury to your decor. PREMIUM QUALITY - The antique picture frame 8 x 10 is well made of environmental resin, includes high definition glass to protect your photo or painting. Beautiful and unique hand painted in a gorgeous antique gold color. It has a traditional black velvet back, with a firm easel and hooks to match. Simply flip the turn buttons on the back and insert a photo. TABLETOP OR WALL MOUNT - This ornate picture frame 8 by 10 can rest either horizontally or vertically on any desktop, shelf, or dresser. It also has two hooks for easy mounting on a wall in portrait and landscape orientation. The cute antique style frame looks like a work of art, adds a sense of old-world feeling to your home, office, studio or gallery wall. GREAT FOR GIFTS - This lovely gold polygon frame is such an ideal gift for anyone who loves old family photos or antique pieces. Whether for a wedding, housewarming, birthday, anniversary, Christmas, Father's Day, Mother's Day or other occasions, this adorable frame delightfully combines sentimental value, practical use, and decorative splendor. Gift it to baby, a best friend, grandma, grandpa, dad, mom, etc. PERFECT SIZE - The retro picture frame's overall dimensions are 9.1\" x 11\" and it is intended to display 8\" x 10\" photos. This kind of classy frame is available in multiple sizes (2.5x3.5, 3x3, 4x6, 5x7, and 8x10). Choose the right fit that best meets your needs and personal taste. See the love in the photo of this fancy frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mDFPoM2gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YULINK","source_asin":"B0BLKPHWSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLKPHWSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLKPHWSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
