window.products.push({"id":503190,"name":"YINGZEN Three Gear Adjustable Milk Frother， Handheld Electric Foam Maker ,2 Stainless Steel replaceable Whisks Head， USB Rechargeable 3 Speed matcha C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TN6LzDTvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A rechargeable milk frother, great design: the design of the stainless steel latte coffee machine is both comfortable and stylish. 1. [Upgraded screwdriver battery] Equipped with double spring eggbeater, the working efficiency is higher. 2. [Upgrade control mode] One-click switching speed, the speed of the milk frother is set to the latest version on/off cycle control mode, low speed-off-medium speed-off-high speed-off. 3. [Specification] Voltage: 5V; Lithium battery capacity: 1200 MAh; Speed: 3 levels adjustable; Weight: about 270g/9.5oz; Size: about 25.5x3cm/10.0x1.2 inches 4. [Product Features and Uses] As long as the bubbler is moved up or down continuously, the foam begins to form immediately. Very suitable for making delicate foam in the kitchen to make latte, cappuccino, hot chocolate, etc. You can mix matcha, bulletproof coffee, protein powder, chai tea, whipped egg whites, and mix green powder. 5. [Instructions]  Find two arrow marks on the mixing part of the mixing head and the milk base, and align the arrow marks.  Insert the stirring rod horizontally into the base, and you will hear a clicking sound when you hear the stirring sound.  When removing the foaming agent, pull the sweeping head horizontally. Generally, the slow speed is very suitable for foaming the milk in the coffee cup. Speeds 2 and 3 are powerful and can make very good foam in large enough cups. 6. [Packaging Contents] 1 *Milk foam stick 1 *Milk foam stirring head 1 *Balloon stirring head 1 *USB charging cable 7. [Tips for Milk Frother]  In order to prevent overflow during use, please try to use a taller container.  Remember to press the button to turn off the milk frother before pulling out the stir bar to avoid liquid splashing. .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TN6LzDTvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YINGZEN","source_asin":"B089NJDDDF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NJDDDF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NJDDDF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
