window.products.push({"id":503401,"name":"Smbeope 100% Mulberry Silk Pillowcase 2 Pack for Hair and Skin,with Hidden Zipper,Both Sides 22 Momme Natural Silk Pillow Cover,Soft Breathable & Smoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5161lAehhmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smbeope is a famous silk pillowcase manufacturer from China with a history of 60 years. The company has more than 10,000 acres of mulberry silk production base and a very large-scale textile factory. All products are handmade. 【100% Silk】 The smbeope silk pillowcase is made of 22 momme silk. The silk fabric of 22 momme is better than 19 momme, the weaving is tighter, and the yarn count is 1.5 times higher. While maintaining soft and smooth, it has better durability. It is a better choice for people who want to have high-quality sleep. 【Hidden zipper】 The smbeope silk pillowcase has a hidden zip design. This makes the pillowcase have a larger opening, making it more convenient to take and place the pillow, and at the same time, it can minimize the impact of the zipper on sleep, and the presence of the zipper is hardly felt. 【SIZE】STANDARD 20’’x26''(50cmX66cm); QUEEN 20''x30''(50cmX76cm); KING 20''x36''(50cmx91cm). 【Skin&Hair】 Pure silk is a natural temperature regulator to help feel cool in summer and warm in winter. Smooth, soft, breathable. Great for preventing facial and neck wrinkles, dry skin, tangled hair, and bed head. Perfect in giving silk care to you face, neck and hair all-night. Unlike cotton or satin, silk won't soak up your expensive night/eye creams. It leaves your face's moisture and oils intact. The perfect gift for Birthday, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Valentine's Day, Christmas. 【CARE INSTRUCTIONS】 Hand washing is best,put a small amount of neutral detergentin cold water.Stir the detergent in the water with your hands before putting it into the clothes.Soak your clothes in water for no more than five minutes.Gently rub and rinse with your hands,do not wring dry,hang dry.If you need an iron please keep the temperature below 35degrees centigrade. ☎If you have any questions, please send email to us, we will work with you to make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5161lAehhmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smbeope","source_asin":"B09BQ1DHHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BQ1DHHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BQ1DHHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
