window.products.push({"id":503546,"name":"HOMCOM Twin XL Adjustable Bed Frame, Ergonomic Zero Gravity Power Bed Base with Head and Foot Incline, Memory, and Wireless Remote, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TNxCRBYaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADJUST THE WAY YOU SLEEP: Get a good night's sleep that is customized to meet your needs with this adjustable bed base. The bed base has independent head and foot tilt adjustments to meet your desired position. The head of the base inclines from 0 to 60 degrees, and the foot of the base inclines from 0 to 45 degrees. MEMORY & ZERO GRAVITY OPTIONS: Relieve muscle tension and sink into comfort with this adjustable base. The base includes a programmable memory option, which allows you to sleep in your customized position with just touch of a button. You can raise your feet above your heart to the zero-gravity position to relieve your soreness and improve your sleep quality. WIRELESS REMOTE CONTROL: Adjust the head and feet position of the power bed base with ease. Simply use the wireless control to choose from flat, zero gravity, or add your own customized options. COMPATIBLE WITH VARIOUS MATTRESSES: Create your own cozy sleeping space with this adjustable base. The bed frame is compatible with memory foam, gel foam, latex foam, and many other types of mattresses. POWER BED BASE INFORMATION: Flat Position: 36.25\"W x 78.75\"D x 13.75\"H, Max Folded Size: 36.25\"W x 70.75\"D x 39.25\"H; Weight Capacity: 440 lbs. Note: Three 3A battery for the remote controller is required, but not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TNxCRBYaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCOM","source_asin":"B09DG3TV4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DG3TV4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DG3TV4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":503547,"name":"HUANGXIN 11.5'' Round Serving Tray Black Decorative Holder Iron Farmhouse Trays Home Decor Table Centerpiece for Coffee Kitchen Dining Room Indoor Out","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GCNQy4fjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY DESIGN - This decor tray is made of the highest-quality iron and handcrafted by skilled artisans.Anti-rust, wear-resistant, and corrosion-resistant. Measures 11.5\" x 11.5\", the perfect size to serve your favorite food and drink for parties or for breakfast in bed. The retro serving tray features a black bottom sponge mat base which is good for protecting table without losing its style. FOR DISPLAY OR STORAGE: Decorative round tray is perfect for rustic table centerpieces and uses on the entryway table, vanity, mantle.Can be used as an ottoman tray, couch tray, sofa tray, or coffee tray in any living room.Apart from serving as a farmhouse serving tray, cocktail tray, or just as a rustic serving tray. Also can add your favorite pillar candles to create a unique candle holder tray or add orbs and make an interesting centerpiece for your coffee table. RUSTIC YET MODERN DECOR TRAY - These metal trays are truly artistic accent decor pieces, rustic style crafted to accentuate your home decor. It will look great in any setting and bring an element of modern country decor. Perfectly for birthdays, weddings, Christmas, baby showers, housewarming, or other holiday celebrations and makes a great gift idea. QUICK & EASY TO MAINTAIN - To keep this platter tray holder sparkly clean, all you need to do is wipe it down with a damp cloth. If needed, you may also use mild cleansers on this table tray. SERVICE - HUANGXIN is committed to developing and delivering high-quality home decorations in an elegant and romantic fashion. We're so confident that you'll love our product, and provide 45 days Money Back Guarantee and 12 Months Warranty. If you have any issues, please contact us, We have a professional team to solve your problem. Purchase with worry-free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GCNQy4fjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUANGXIN","source_asin":"B0BG5D5PTJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG5D5PTJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG5D5PTJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
