window.products.push({"id":503639,"name":"Custom Blanket with Photos Text Personalized Flannel Throw Blankets Customized Blanket for Baby Family Best Friend Birthday Christmas Halloween Father","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ky0eKKQHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<b>Custom Blanket with Any Photo:</b> Custom blanket are a unique way to record memories, allowing you to warm memories and turn them into unique blankets. You can customized blankets with photos of your kids, baby,family, friends, wedding, pets, even selfies of yourself, You can also add special any text/date/name/unique word (Best Dad/Mom/Family ever, Happy 60th Anniversary,Home is the best haven)to the picture blanket. <b>Super Soft Flannel Blanket：</b>Personalized blanket are made of high quality anti-pilling flannel,soft and comfortable, warm, breathable, light, wrinkle resistant, no fading, fiber does not fall off.Use the HD printing technology and environmentally friendly printing ink materials to make the image clearly displayed on the blanket, no smell, machine wash does not shrink, 100% safety skin friendly. <b>4 Sizes Available:</b>30\"x40\"-used for swaddle blanket,40\"x50\"-used for baby blankets or pet blanket.50\"x60\"-are suitable for teenagers.and 60\"x80\"- are suitable for adults can also be used by multiple people together.It can be used as sleeping blankets,summer quilt Air-conditioning blanket,leisure blankets,sofa blanket,nap blankets,baby carriage blankets,throw blanket. <b>Personalized Gifts:</b>Customized blankets with photos or text will be great gifts to your mom,dad,sister,baby,friends,girlfriend,boyfriend,family or even yourself, as well as souvenirs for various anniversaries or festival, such as Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Valentine’s Day, Halloween, Birthday, Wedding. It's also a lovely gift for your dogs and cats! <b>Customize Steps:</b>1.Choose the blanket style and size,and then Click “Customize Now” yellow button to start customize.2.Choose the blanket background color you want.3.Upload your unique photos or images.4.Choose the font and input the text you want to write on the blanket.5.The last step,click the “Add to Cart”button.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ky0eKKQHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PalmLove","source_asin":"B0BBKSTC2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBKSTC2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBKSTC2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
