window.products.push({"id":503643,"name":"KOMFOTT Rollaway Bed with 4” Mattress, Folding Bed with Memory Foam Mattress for Adults, Portable Guest Bed with Sturdy Steel Frame, Made in Italy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x1L97yWdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Wanna experience a restful and comfortable sleep or nap at any time for great convenience? Our luxurious and soft rollaway guest bed with mattress is a perfect option for you! Our folding bed is constructed of steel tube construction combined with the premium wood slat support, creating a firm foundation for the weight capacity of 440 lbs. Featuring a thick mattress, our bed provides a comfortable sleep with no deform and collapsing foam. Adopting a foldable design, the sleeper bed can be set up or folded up in seconds. The four wheel casters provide easy mobility to any room or storage area when not in use. Great for sleepovers and small space living and can be widely used in the living room, bedroom, study, and office. Feature 15 solid wooden slats provide reinforced supportStable steel frame with resistance to bending and deformationHigh-density support foam and soft memory foam for ultra softnessFoldable design with sturdy buckle for space-saving storage 4 smooth rolling wheels offer convenient transportationStable support to bear up to 440 lbsSuitable for guest room, study room, office, camping, travel, etc Specification Color of Frame: BlackColor of Mattress: Beige/Navy BlueMaterial: Steel + Memory Foam + PolyurethaneOverall Dimensions: 75\" x 32\" x 13\" (L x W x H)Folding Dimensions: 32\" x 13\" x 42\" (L x W x H)Mattress Thickness: 2.5\" Net Weight: 33 lbsWeight Capacity: 440 lbsPackage Includes：1 x Folding Bed1 x InstructionWhy do you choose our rollaway folding bed ?√Foldable design and universal wheels ensure easy storage and transportation.√High resilience memory foam and supportive foam provide ultimate comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x1L97yWdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOMFOTT","source_asin":"B09JWJRVR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JWJRVR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JWJRVR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
