window.products.push({"id":503678,"name":"Gadjit Cup Keeper 2.0 Cup Holder Adapter w/Base Band for 18, 20, 21, 24 oz Hydro Flasks 12,18,20,30 oz Yeti Tumbler, Coffee & Travel Mugs with Bottoms","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pI5-zGOHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gadjit CUP KEEPER 2.0 Cup Holder Adapter w/ Adjustable Base Band will hold beverage containers with a BASE DIAMETER of 2.35\" or LESS. It fits many styles of Hydro Flasks 18 21 24 oz, Yeti Tumbler 20 & 30 oz, Coffee & Travel Mugs 28 oz, Convenience Store Cups 48 oz, 1-liter Bottle. EXPAND CAR BEVERAGE HOLDERS to 3.25\" in DIAMETER - NEW Gadjit Cup Keeper 2.0 with Adjustable-fit Beverage Band Expands your Car Cup Holder to accommodate Mugs and Convenience Store Cups up to 3.25” wide and Water & Soda Bottles up to 1 liter. NEW ADJUSTABLE FIT - The Silicone Compression Beverage Band allows you to adjust the diameter of Cup Keeper 2.0’s base for a snug fit in your vehicle's drink holder. Use in cars, trucks, RVs, golf carts, tractors, and more. Portable -- it goes where you go. WILL IT FIT MY BEVERAGE? It fits Hydro Flask 18 oz, 21 oz, 24 oz, Yeti 20 oz Tumbler, 30 oz Tumbler, 12oz JR, 12 oz Bottle, 18 oz Bottle. --- Coffee Shop Cups up to 28 oz, Gas Station Soda Fountain Cups up to 48 oz, and Water Bottles up to 1 liter (32 oz). Will NOT fit large the Yeti Tumblers over 30 oz, the Hydro Flasks 32 oz, and 40 oz. or any of the Nalgene Water Bottles. WILL THIS FIT MY CUP HOLDER? To ensure a good fit – PLEASE MEASURE the diameter and depth of your existing cup holder. Cup Keeper 2.0 will fit if your cup holder is 2.5-3.5\" in diameter and is about 2\" deep. Slide the beverage band up or down the base to adjust for a snug fit and wobble-free beverages. If your cup holder is 2.5” wide, you may not need to use the enclosed beverage band. If it’s wider than 2.5” using the beverage band will create a snugger and more stable fit. IF your cup holder is larger than 3.5\", Cup Keeper 2.0 will fit but may not fill the entire diameter snuggly, so please measure before you buy! We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee so that you're not stuck with something that won't work. PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pI5-zGOHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gadjit","source_asin":"B0842XTFH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842XTFH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842XTFH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
