window.products.push({"id":503696,"name":"Wonder Home 5 Pieces Oversized King Comforter Set with 100% Cotton Shell and Polyester Filling, Luxury Grey and White Striped Comforter with 2 Shams, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vjoa68f5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our OEKO-TEX Standard certified factory has been supplying U.S big brands with luxurious, modern and eco-friendly home textiles for years, now we sell on our own store to let every family easily turn their home into a luxurious experience at an affordable cost. We believe every family deserves a wonderful bedroom of their dreams. Specifications: Size: Queen Color: White, Blue, Brown, Grey Set Includes: 1pc Comforter 92\"(L)x 96\"(W), about 2.8 LB 2pc Shams 20\"x 26\" 1pc Square Embroidered Pillow 16” x 16” (filling: 350gsm) 1pc Oblong Embroidered Pillow 12” x 16”(filling: 250gsm) Fabric: 100% premium cotton twill(200 thread count); Filling: 100% plush down alternative polyester(220gsm). Fabric and Design: 100% cotton face and back, 100% polyester filling. Super natural soft hand feel, durable, no pilling. Grey and white stripes design, make your bedroom simple, elegant and classy. Features: Produced in OEKO-TEX Standard certified factory, healthy for you and environment. 100% cotton shell(200 thread count) provides a luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning. Hypoallergenic down alternative filling is perfect for those allergic to traditional down. Medium weight filling(220gsm) adds proper weight to your covering, keeping you warm and make you feel more comfortable. Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitching, no tearing, pilling, shifting or bunching. Care Instructions Machine wash cold, gentle cycle with like colors only, non-chlorine bleach when needed, tumble dry low, warm iron when needed. Ready to transform your bedroom? Just scroll up and click “Add to Cart”! Quantities Limited.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vjoa68f5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B07671RHTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07671RHTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07671RHTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":503697,"name":"Sunbeam Channeled Velvet Plush Electric Heated Blanket King Seashell","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WskTn-xaL._AC_.jpg","description":"Indulge in the rich softness of the Sunbeam Channeled Velvet Plush Heated Blanket, King Size Seashell Off-White. The beautiful ultra-soft velvety fabric is smooth to the touch. Stylish channel pattern and hemmed edges finish off the blanket with sophistication. The thermofine warming system of the blanket monitors temperature and auto-adjusts to keep the level of warmth consistent throughout the night. Sunbeam blankets are a smart way to cut energy costs as well. They allow you to save up to 10% a year on your heating bills by turning on your heated blanket and setting your thermostat down by 10-15% for 8 hours while sleeping. Made of 100% polyester, the blanket presents a soft surface that is smooth and soothing to the touch. The blanket includes 10 heating levels, while an easy-to-operate LCD display control makes it simple to find exactly the right setting. Features include pre-heat and 10 hour auto-off for safety. For easy care, the blanket is fully machine washable and dryer safe. Also includes a Limited Warranty from Sunbeam. -Twin (62 in x 83 in) Single Heating Control -Full (72 in x 83 in) Single Heating Control-Queen (84 in x 89 in) Dual Heating Controls -King (100 in x 89 in) Dual Heating Controls *Note for Customers Outside of North America. These heated bedding products were made to work with 110V Electrical systems. If you live in a country that utilizes a different electrical system you may need to use a converter for these products to function. The act of using a converter automatically voids the warranty on these products. **All Sunbeam Blankets are rigorously tested and approved by a third party (UL or ETK Intertek) to comply with current industry safety standards. Please reference the included use and safety instructions to insure safe operation. Additional safety certification for this product can be viewed on the UL or Intertek websites or by calling their perspective customer care phone numbers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WskTn-xaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunbeam","source_asin":"B00MSXIQ1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MSXIQ1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MSXIQ1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
