window.products.push({"id":503723,"name":"Waterford Classic Silver Personalized 5x7 Picture Frame, Custom Engraved 5x7 Frame for Wedding, Anniversary, Family Photos and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gCvQsA+FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WATERFORD CLASSIC SILVER PERSONALIZED 5x7 PICTURE FRAME Preserve, protect, and display your most cherished photos while adding a lovely touch to your home décor with the timeless Waterford Classic 5x7 Picture Frame. This contemporary and elegant 5x7 frame by Waterford borders your photos with the look of gleaming silver, with a high quality look and heavy duty feel. Featuring clean lines with a modern style, the Classic frame is durably crafted of silver-plated heavy gauge brass with a beautiful non-tarnish lacquer finish so that it never needs polishing. Each frame includes a protective glass dust cover to protect against wear, fading, and damage, as well as a sturdy built-in easel for tabletop display.  While Waterford is a pioneer in design, sometimes the most simple patterns remain the most popular. That's certainly the case with the Classic Collection, which features a timeless frame recognizable in style to all. Each frame comes presented in Waterford Signature Gift Box Packaging. INCLUDED ENGRAVING SERVICE Our team of professionals will make each frame one of a kind with our included engraving service. Select a font style and add any text of your choosing to the top and/or bottom of the frame to create a luxurious gift with a personal touch for someone special to you. Click ' Customize Now' to begin your order and review engraving options. ITEM SPECIFICATIONS Manufacturer: Waterford Model: Classic 5x7 Frame Model Number: W3057 Color: Silver Engraving Color: Frosted Materials: Silver-Plated Stainless Steel Display Type: Tabletop Orientation: Portrait (Vertical) Protective Glass Photo Cover Non-Tarnish Laquer Finish Built-In Easel Waterford Signature Gift Box Packaging","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gCvQsA+FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford","source_asin":"B079MFHWSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-503723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079MFHWSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079MFHWSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
